  "description": "Why Choose Actbest Core ST 2.0 Plus 27.5 Inch ?\nImagine gliding through your morning commute, completely relaxed and sweat-free. The Core ST 2.0 Plus 2.0 step-through ebike turns the daily grind into a joyride.\nInstead of fighting steep city hills, our advanced torque sensor reads your exact pedaling effort and delivers a buttery-smooth, natural boost. It feels less like riding a machine and more like having bionic legs. With a robust 1200W peak motor quietly working in the background, you'll effortlessly hit 28 mph and explore up to 100 miles on a single charge without a drop of range anxiety.\nSay goodbye to jarring street bumps. The adjustable front suspension, plush saddle, and large 27.5-inch wheels absorb the rough pavement, giving you a cloud-like, pain-free ride tailored to your perfect posture.\nArrive at your destination looking sharp—full fenders block dirty road spray, while the sturdy rear rack easily hauls your heavy backpack or groceries. Backed by all-weather disc brakes and crisp Shimano shifting, this ebike makes every journey feel safe, effortlessly smooth, and genuinely fun.",
